<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-SNAIGE POSTS H1 2.047 MLN LITAS. [CORRECTED 13:36 GMT]</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-SNAIGE POSTS H1 2.047 MLN LITAS. [CORRECTED 13:36 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997 (correcting year)</p>
<p>				    (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss		   2.047	vs   loss 1.528</p>
<p>    Turnover			  63.6	vs	   70.9</p>
<p>    Operating costs		  4.8	 vs   4.9</p>
<p>    Operating loss		   1.4	 vs  loss 268,000</p>
<p>    Extraordinary profit	 745,000     vs   46,000</p>
<p>NOTE -- Fridge producer Snaige had a first quarter loss of</p>
<p>4.2 million litas and a net profit of 625,000 litas in 1996 on</p>
<p>turnover of 45.26 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
